ice!</h2><br> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Buy good quality furniture<br>       </li><li> Change the appearance of the walls<br>       </li><li> Buy high quality food<br>       </li><li> Expensive fitness equipment lasts longer</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985910/extras/34bccca43a69b968b61491df16bc8ff1.avif?t=1673355001\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It's not always relaxed. The more guests, the more stress!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hire employees and expand your hotel for the best possible satisfaction of your guests</h2><br> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Cook food for your guests<br>       </li><li> Deliver food ordered via phone call<br>       </li><li> Repair damaged furniture and equipment<br>       </li><li> Clean the rooms<br>       </li><li> Sweep the hallways</li></ul><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">If you like the game concept, adding the game to your wishlist will help me enormously!</h2></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2665 THANK YOU \u2665</h2><br>",
